{"message":"Your Gold Rewards Card has been permanently closed successfully.

You have 45 days from today to redeem your remaining 8,200 reward points; any points left after that will be forfeited. You’ll receive a confirmation email and final statement within several business days. If an annual fee posted within the last 37 days, you may be eligible for a full refund.

Please also note that closing a card can affect your credit score by reducing available credit and increasing utilization."}
